==English==

===Noun===
'''[[main]] [[diagonal]]''' (''plural'' '''main diagonals''')

# {{linearalg}} The (imagined) diagonal line from the top left to the bottom right of a [[square matrix]].
#: ''In a diagonal matrix, non-zero elements appear only on the main diagonal.''

